        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightCoral"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jacob</span> nearly instantly gets your first life by performing some insane, flashing green combo while you’re still learning the controls.</span> He chuckles at this, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wait, do you not know how to play? Dang, you just must WANT to give me your money!”</span> He laughs, sounding very cocky as you respawn and run at him. <br>
<br>
The next fight goes better, though you’re still outmatched. You discover how the combos work and that the game revolves around trying to throw your opponent off the stage. But his character seems far more suited to the game than yours, or you’re just bad, but you’d never admit that. Soon, you find yourself at the edge of the arena, inches away from death, as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jacob</span>’s character approaches your slowly. <span style="color:Yellow">He drags it out, laughing with a cockiness reserved solely for young boys who believe themselves so smart.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Too bad, but hey, you’ll have one more life left.”</span> He smirks deviously, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You’ll get it next time, I believe in you!”</span> <span style="color:Pink">His words are filled with childish mockery, which you’d find charming if you weren’t worried about that punishment for losing.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, check this out! I can beat you without even looking!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jacob</span> closes his eyes as his character charges at yours, ready to attack and push you off. Taking your second life, bringing you down to one when you’ve hardly even hurt his character. <br>
<br>
Then something happens. Maybe someone is looking out for you, maybe the universe just wants to humble the cocky <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jacob</span>, or maybe he was simply the instrument of his own downfall. <span style="color:LightGreen">For right when <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jacob</span> is about to hit you, you press one random button. A last-ditch attempt, a last chance… and you counter his attack perfectly. You fling his character off the edge! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jacob</span> feels his controller vibrate and opens his eyes in confusion. But it’s too late, just too late. Had he been looking, had he not been so cocky, so sure of his ability, he may have been able to recover.</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "OC JACOB",
                State: {
